#: ../../source/docs/ArduPlane_MAVLink_Messages.rst:5
#: ea9b81e875a44250bc911bbc0a666888
msgid "MAVLink Messages"
msgstr "MAVLink消息"

#: ../../source/docs/ArduPlane_MAVLink_Messages.rst:8
#: 909cdfb23ba44c97814460fcc3e672b5
msgid ""
"The `MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`_ protocol supports a variety of "
"features and functionalities, but not all `messages "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/>`_ or `commands "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/command.html>`_ are implemented by the "
"ArduPilot ecosystem, or relevant to a particular autopilot firmware."
msgstr ""
"`MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`_ 协议支持多种特性和功能，但并非所有 `消息 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/>`_ 或 `命令 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/command.html>`_ 都已在 ArduPilot "
"生态系统中实现，也不一定与特定飞控固件相关。"

#: ../../source/docs/ArduPlane_MAVLink_Messages.rst:10
#: a5e2ac8d0b4f40f39e842f7f7ce36bff
msgid ""
"This page is auto-generated from analysing the ArduPlane source code, and"
" provides an indication of which messages (and commands) are handled by, "
"requestable from, and sent from the firmware. A message being handled "
"does not guarantee full support, but at least shows that the autopilot is"
" aware it exists, and will try to do something meaningful with it."
msgstr ""
"本页面通过分析 ArduPlane "
"源代码自动生成，提供固件所处理、可请求及发送的消息（和命令）的说明。消息被处理并不代表完全支持，但至少表明飞控已知晓其存在，并会尝试做出有意义的响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/ArduPlane_MAVLink_Messages.rst:12
#: d73020cbbbf04f9ba9810010425070a7
msgid ""
"Known :ref:`unsupported messages <ArduPlane_mavlink_missing_messages>` "
"(and commands) are shown at the end."
msgstr "已知的 :ref:`不支持消息 <ArduPlane_mavlink_missing_messages>` （及命令）显示在末尾。"

#: ../../source/docs/ArduPlane_MAVLink_Messages.rst:14
#: 8716937bd2f54706b0512a74a0670e8a
msgid ""
"The autopilot includes a set of :ref:`ArduPlane_mavlink_stream_groups` "
"for convenience, which allow configuring the stream rates of groups of "
"requestable messages by setting parameter values. It is also possible to "
"manually request messages, and request individual messages be streamed at"
" a specified rate."
msgstr ""
"飞控包含一组 :ref:`ArduPlane_mavlink_stream_groups` "
"以便使用，可通过设置参数值来配置可请求消息组的流速率。也可以手动请求消息，并以指定速率请求单个消息的流式传输。"

